","FALSE"],chips:["D3","Lookup!$H$2:$I$6","2","FALSE","TRUE","H2","1","Lookup!$H$2"],explain:"<code>=VLOOKUP(D3, Lookup!$H$2:$I$6, 2, FALSE)</code>"},{sec:"eng",type:"order",prompt:"Put the steps VLOOKUP takes in the right order. Tap them 1 to 5.",visual:()=>({fx:o}),items:["Read the value in F2","Jump to the first column of the table (E13:E15)","Scan down until it finds an exact match","Move across the same row to column 2","Return the value it lands on"],explain:"Read, jump, scan down, move across, return. Think of your finger going <b>down</b> then <b>across</b>."},{sec:"typo",type:"typo",prompt:"This shows #NAME?. Fix it.",broken:"=VLOKUP(F2, Analysis!$E$13:$F$15, 2, FALSE)",fixed:"=VLOOKUP(F2,Analysis!$E$13:$F$15,2,FALSE)",shown:o,hint:"Check the spelling of the function name.",explain:"<b>VLOKUP</b> should be <b>VLOOKUP</b> (two Os). A misspelt function gives <b>#NAME?</b>"},{sec:"typo",type:"typo",prompt:"This gives the wrong result. Fix it.",broken:"=VLOOKUP(F2 Analysis!$E$13:$F$15, 2, FALSE)",fixed:"=VLOOKUP(F2,Analysis!$E$13:$F$15,2,FALSE)",shown:o,hint:"Count the commas. There should be 3 of them separating 4 arguments.",explain:"A comma was missing after <b>F2</b>. Four arguments need <b>three</b> commas."},{sec:"typo",type:"typo",prompt:"The range is broken. Fix it.",broken:"=VLOOKUP(F2, Analysis!$E$13;$F$15, 2, FALSE)",fixed:"=VLOOKUP(F2,Analysis!$E$13:$F$15,2,FALSE)",shown:o,hint:"A range from one cell to another uses a colon, not a semicolon.",explain:'Ranges use a <b>colon</b>: <code>$E$13:$F$15</code> means "E13 to F15".'},{sec:"typo",type:"typo",prompt:"Excel cannot find the other sheet. Fix it.",broken:"=VLOOKUP(F2, Analysis$E$13:$F$15, 2, FALSE)",fixed:"=VLOOKUP(F2,Analysis!$E$13:$F$15,2,FALSE)",shown:o,hint:"Sheet names need a special symbol between them and the cell reference.",explain:"A sheet name is always followed by an <b>exclamation mark</b>: <code>Analysis!</code>"},{sec:"typo",type:"typo",prompt:"Two typos in this one! Fix both.",broke