pe FALSE. Leaving it off means TRUE."],["7","#N/A? Check spelling, spaces (TRIM) and numbers stored as text."],["8","Read it back with the sentence frame to check it says what you mean."]]},ratings:["VLOOKUP Legend","Lookup Pro","Getting There","Keep Practising"],footer:o};export{a as COLORS,g as VLOOKUP_GAME};
